<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Woodside signs new Australia gas deal.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Woodside signs new Australia gas deal.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-07-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Woodside Petroleum Ltd, operator of the North West Shelf oil and gas project off Western Australia, said on Wednesday it had signed a new 15-year contract to supply Western Australian government-owned Alinta Gas.</p>
</text>
